  "description": "Iana Greenwood, a young lady of a count's family, receives a terminal diagnosis giving her only six months left to live. Losing even her sight and doing nothing except waiting for death, Iana notices the presence of a man who comes to change the flowers in her room every day.\n\n\"You. Starting today, you will attend to me.\" \n\nTaking a liking to him—Mac, the gardener's son—Iana brings him in as her personal servant, and their relationship takes an unexpected turn. A story about a dying woman and the man who stays by her side.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14860576)",
